# Per-customer wrangler configs generated by migrations/deploy_all.py —
# see docs/decisions/0012-deploy-all.md. Machine-generated, always
# reconstructible from the fleet manifest plus the checked-in
# wrangler.jsonc; never a second source of truth to keep in sync by
# hand. Flat files directly inside each Worker's own directory,
# deliberately not a subdirectory — see deploy_all.py's own comment on
# why a subdirectory silently broke `main` path resolution live.
workers/*/.deploy-generated.*.wrangler.json
